   MLton is released under a HPND-style license; see LICENSES/MLton.txt.

   Classification uses ASCII tables and character equality.
   Case conversion uses a bounded source table, requiring no code conversion primitive.
   Non-ASCII characters are unchanged; this is not Unicode case folding. */

from "./subset_result.wm" import * as SubsetResult;
